<overview>
<p>A Clan combat engineer Point, a rarity among the warrior-focused Clans. Drawing on Star League engineering practices carried into the Exodus, these laborer- and technician-caste troops build fighting positions and clear obstacles for the touman. By the mid-2800s the Clans increasingly regarded such work as beneath a true warrior, and dedicated engineer Points had all but vanished by 2840.</p>
</overview>
